  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EWASSA 2- Bridge funding continued programming.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We have been engaging Grundfos Foundation since Q1 and were able to secure a bridge funding for continued software programming, i.e., to keep both the donor and Practical Action visible, maintain our partnership grip with key stakeholders, including the County Government of Turkana, NGOs, and other private sector entities, and secure the project&apos;s achievements and gains for the next one year as the donor reorganizes its strategy for the potential RFP release.</narrative>
  </description>
